# Signing material and anything shaped like it. None of this should ever be in the repo —
# the source is public, the identity that signs it is not. Listed defensively rather than
# relying on remembering: a leaked key means revoking the certificate and reissuing.
*.p12
*.p8
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
developer-id.*

# Model weights staged for the offline installer build — gigabytes, fetched on demand.
apps/desktop/models/
apps/desktop/build/extensions-packed/
